  helpLongHow_admin_outbound: '① Pick store, date, and filters first, then open a row in the list or a detail form.\n② Use the Store by Month tab for yearly matrices (subtotal and VAT-inclusive); click a cell to drill into History.\n③ Fill required fields with correct types (dates, numbers, selects), and re-check amounts and approvers before Save, Submit, or Approve.\n④ If data looks stale, refresh; if it persists, check concurrency and month-end rules with ops or accounting to avoid double booking.\n⑤ Export and print only with appropriate rights; follow your org’s data-handling and retention policy.',
  helpLongWhat_admin_accounting_purchase_order: 'This screen is for “Accounting view of purchase orders and budgets”. The exact store scope, tabs, and fields depend on your role, org, and process (head office vs franchise, accounting close, etc.). External systems (POS, bank, cloud) may have replication delay or concurrency rules; refresh before you rely on balances. Use PII, payroll, and tax data with least privilege, and be careful with exports and screenshots outside approved channels.',
